---
import SectionIntro from '../ui/SectionIntro.astro';
---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-paper relative border-b border-borderMuted">
  <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <SectionIntro
      eyebrow="TRANSPARENCY & STANDARDS"
      heading="What to Expect from Tiwari Enterprises"
      lead="We believe in clear commitments rather than marketing slogans. Here is exactly what we promise every client in Pune."
      className="mb-14 sm:mb-20"
    />

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="p-8 bg-surface border border-borderMuted flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gold font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3">01 / SPECIFICATIONS</span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl uppercase font-bold text-ink mb-3">Itemised Material Verification</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
            Every quote explicitly names the aluminium alloy grade, profile wall thickness, glass processing stamp, and hardware brand. No substituted materials or hidden downgrades.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-borderMuted mt-6 text-[11px] text-ink font-semibold uppercase font-mono">
          Verified Specs Only
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 bg-surface border border-borderMuted flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gold font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3">02 / MEASUREMENTS</span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl uppercase font-bold text-ink mb-3">Pre-Fabrication Site Sign-Off</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
            We confirm structural civil levels, finished flooring heights, and ceiling reveal recesses before raw material cutting begins, ensuring seamless fit upon delivery.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-borderMuted mt-6 text-[11px] text-ink font-semibold uppercase font-mono">
          Laser Surveyed
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 bg-surface border border-borderMuted flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xs">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-gold font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3">03 / HANDOVER</span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl uppercase font-bold text-ink mb-3">Testing &amp; Protection</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
            We inspect every roller mechanism, latch lock, and weather silicone joint. Completed installations are masked with protective film until civil site cleaning is finished.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-borderMuted mt-6 text-[11px] text-ink font-semibold uppercase font-mono">
          Clean Site Delivery
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
